; Frosty AK Integration
; AK-101-only MAS/PUSSY compatibility patch.
; Unscoped ADS uses attach_base + aim, so the aim values below compensate the
; 3DSS EFT Reposition attachment base and resolve to Frosty's native AK-101 ADS.
; Scoped ADS keeps the reposition attachment base used by PUSSY scope offsets.

